WEBVTT

00:00:11.779 --> 00:00:12.829
Oh!

00:00:12.829 --> 00:00:14.809
[EVIL LAUGHTER]

00:00:14.809 --> 00:00:16.779
Ah!

00:00:16.779 --> 00:00:18.559
Anybody hungry?

00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:19.609
Ha!

00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:21.599
[EVIL LAUGHTER] Oh?

00:00:21.599 --> 00:00:23.599
Ha!

00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:25.529
Aah!

00:00:25.529 --> 00:00:26.579
Ugh.

00:00:30.569 --> 00:00:32.059
Aaah.

00:00:32.059 --> 00:00:33.829
Oh, Snowball.

00:00:33.829 --> 00:00:34.879
SNOWBALL: Aah.

00:00:34.879 --> 00:00:35.929
Aah.

00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:37.039
Waah.

00:00:37.039 --> 00:00:38.679
Uh, is he OK?

00:00:38.679 --> 00:00:39.969
Not in any way.

00:00:39.969 --> 00:00:41.819
No.

00:00:41.819 --> 00:00:43.299
[LIGHTHEARTED MUSIC]

00:00:43.299 --> 00:00:45.099
Hello, citizens.

00:00:45.099 --> 00:00:46.419
Who is that?

00:00:46.419 --> 00:00:47.529
Mm-mm-mm.

00:00:47.529 --> 00:00:49.179
I'm Captain Snowball.

00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:51.309
I hear one of you needs my help.

00:00:51.309 --> 00:00:52.509
Oh, that's me.

00:00:52.509 --> 00:00:54.399
Ah, very good.

00:00:54.399 --> 00:00:56.949
New dog, tell me your story.

00:00:56.949 --> 00:00:57.999
OK.

00:00:57.999 --> 00:01:01.989
Well, it all began when I was
on my way back from vacation.

00:01:05.099 --> 00:01:06.149
[JAZZ MUSIC]

00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.859
DAISY (VOICEOVER): Our
humans were safely stowed

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:09.479
in the overhead compartment.

00:01:09.479 --> 00:01:11.889
And we were going through
our owner's stuff.

00:01:11.889 --> 00:01:14.359
[LAUGHS] Humans always
blame the airline.

00:01:14.359 --> 00:01:15.869
[BARKING AND CRASHES]

00:01:17.129 --> 00:01:18.359
What do you got?

00:01:18.359 --> 00:01:21.569
I'll trade you two socks
for a pair of workout shorts.

00:01:21.569 --> 00:01:23.409
Are they clean or dirty?

00:01:23.409 --> 00:01:24.689
They ain't clean.

00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:26.729
[SNIFFS] No.

00:01:26.729 --> 00:01:27.929
They're nasty.

00:01:27.929 --> 00:01:28.979
[CRASH]

00:01:28.979 --> 00:01:32.159
DAISY (VOICEOVER): And
then, I heard a noise.

00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:33.209
Oh.
[RATTLING]

00:01:33.209 --> 00:01:34.259
Ugh.

00:01:34.259 --> 00:01:35.659
Oh.

00:01:35.659 --> 00:01:36.709
Mm.

00:01:40.469 --> 00:01:41.519
[CLANGING]

00:01:41.519 --> 00:01:43.289
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:01:44.339 --> 00:01:45.389
Argh.

00:01:52.419 --> 00:01:53.469
[PLAINTIVE PURR AND GROWL]

00:01:53.469 --> 00:01:54.519
[CHAINS CLANGING]

00:01:54.519 --> 00:01:57.329
DAISY (VOICEOVER): Now, I
don't speak wild animal.

00:01:57.329 --> 00:02:01.229
But from what I gathered, he
was a scared, adorable tiger cub

00:02:01.229 --> 00:02:02.879
name Hu.

00:02:02.879 --> 00:02:06.299
This poor baby kitty was
being held against his will.

00:02:06.299 --> 00:02:07.349
Whoa.

00:02:07.349 --> 00:02:09.119
That is unbelievable.

00:02:09.119 --> 00:02:10.169
I know, right?

00:02:10.169 --> 00:02:12.449
No, I mean, I literally
don't believe a word of it.

00:02:12.449 --> 00:02:13.499
No offense.

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:14.729
Or do take offense.

00:02:14.729 --> 00:02:15.779
I'm good either way.

00:02:15.779 --> 00:02:17.089
Um, pardon me.

00:02:17.089 --> 00:02:19.559
Offense is very much taken.

00:02:19.559 --> 00:02:21.449
That story happened.
And it gets worse.

00:02:21.449 --> 00:02:22.499
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:02:22.499 --> 00:02:24.029
After the plane
landed, I saw Hu again.

00:02:24.029 --> 00:02:25.079
[WHINE]

00:02:25.079 --> 00:02:26.129
[CLANGING]

00:02:26.129 --> 00:02:27.479
[COMPLAINING COMMENTS]

00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:30.179
DAISY (VOICEOVER): He was
being brought to his new owner.

00:02:30.179 --> 00:02:31.629
And this guy--

00:02:31.629 --> 00:02:32.679
The name is Rubels.

00:02:32.679 --> 00:02:34.049
DAISY (VOICEOVER):
Yeah, this guy

00:02:34.049 --> 00:02:39.849
was pure, concentrated,
circus evil.

00:02:39.849 --> 00:02:42.249
That tiger needs
Captain Snowball.

00:02:42.249 --> 00:02:43.899
Daisy, let's go.

00:02:43.899 --> 00:02:45.399
Yeah.

00:02:45.399 --> 00:02:46.449
Ugh.

00:02:46.449 --> 00:02:47.499
Let's free that tiger.

00:02:47.499 --> 00:02:48.759
Or die trying.

00:02:48.759 --> 00:02:49.869
Well, I mean--

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.359
- I mean, we might.
- Um.

00:02:51.359 --> 00:02:52.729
- Probably you.
- Huh?

00:02:52.729 --> 00:02:54.079
You're wearing
the bright suit.

00:02:54.079 --> 00:02:55.419
Everyone's going to notice you.

00:02:55.419 --> 00:02:56.719
I'll be fine.

00:02:56.719 --> 00:02:58.699
[WHIMPER]

00:02:58.699 --> 00:03:00.179
[HAPPY MUSIC]

00:03:10.059 --> 00:03:12.039
[SQUAWK]

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:14.409
Hey, guys.

00:03:14.409 --> 00:03:15.459
We're here.

00:03:15.459 --> 00:03:17.299
Oh, yaay.

00:03:17.299 --> 00:03:19.189
[SNORES]

00:03:20.239 --> 00:03:22.689
[SQUAWK]

00:03:22.689 --> 00:03:24.829
[LAUGHS] Hey, there.

00:03:24.829 --> 00:03:26.449
There's Uncle Shep.

00:03:26.449 --> 00:03:27.809
Welcome to the farm.

00:03:27.809 --> 00:03:29.029
[LAUGHTER]

00:03:29.029 --> 00:03:30.379
Where's my little man?

00:03:30.379 --> 00:03:36.279
[LAUGHS]

00:03:36.279 --> 00:03:38.249
[FARM SOUNDS]

00:03:41.709 --> 00:03:44.509
Oh, wow.

00:03:44.509 --> 00:03:46.039
Look at this place.

00:03:46.039 --> 00:03:47.089
Yeah, it's--

00:03:47.089 --> 00:03:48.139
[LAUGHS]

00:03:48.139 --> 00:03:49.269
Huh?

00:03:49.269 --> 00:03:51.649
So many smells I've
never smelled before.

00:03:51.649 --> 00:03:53.719
My nose is so
confused and happy.

00:03:53.719 --> 00:03:55.389
[LAUGHS] Come on Max.

00:03:55.389 --> 00:03:56.439
Let's go explore.

00:03:56.439 --> 00:03:59.669
[LAUGHS] Yeah!

00:03:59.669 --> 00:04:02.419
Uh, wait up.

00:04:02.419 --> 00:04:04.449
[LAUGHS] Oh.

00:04:04.449 --> 00:04:08.179
Hey, cow, moo.

00:04:08.179 --> 00:04:09.509
[BELL]

00:04:09.509 --> 00:04:10.789
You're a cow.

00:04:10.789 --> 00:04:12.689
You're supposed to moo.

00:04:12.689 --> 00:04:13.949
[LAUGHS]

00:04:13.949 --> 00:04:15.359
Woof woof.

00:04:15.359 --> 00:04:16.409
What?

00:04:16.409 --> 00:04:17.509
Oh, I'm a dog.

00:04:17.509 --> 00:04:19.719
I'm wagging my
tail like an idiot.

00:04:19.719 --> 00:04:20.769
[PANTING]

00:04:20.769 --> 00:04:22.059
Oh, OK dude.

00:04:22.059 --> 00:04:23.109
Not cool.

00:04:23.109 --> 00:04:24.729
Oh, are you going
to throw a ball?

00:04:24.729 --> 00:04:26.119
Oh, please, throw a ball.

00:04:26.119 --> 00:04:27.349
And I will chase
it, because my brain

00:04:27.349 --> 00:04:28.969
is the size of a rat turd.

00:04:28.969 --> 00:04:30.499
[LAUGHS] OK.

00:04:30.499 --> 00:04:31.699
Yeah, I get it.
You made your point.

00:04:31.699 --> 00:04:32.749
Oh, look.

00:04:32.749 --> 00:04:34.069
I'm peeing on a tree.
I now own this tree.

00:04:34.069 --> 00:04:35.119
OK, yeah.
Great.

00:04:35.119 --> 00:04:36.169
Leaving now.

00:04:36.169 --> 00:04:38.839
COW: I guess I'll just stare at
the door until you come back.

00:04:38.839 --> 00:04:40.229
Oh, I miss New York.

00:04:40.229 --> 00:04:42.979
Maybe a break from the
city is just what you need.

00:04:42.979 --> 00:04:44.089
This place is--

00:04:44.089 --> 00:04:45.469
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:04:45.469 --> 00:04:46.519
What?

